  'sy.d.flat': 'The same bet every time. The smallest swings; the loss is close to edge × wagered.',
  'sy.d.martin': 'Double after a loss, back to the base after a win. Many small wins — but a losing run makes the bet explode and one loss is huge.',
  'sy.d.paroli': 'Double after a win; back to the base after three wins or a loss. Small losses, big wins only on a winning run — the "reverse Martingale".',
